Subject: [PATCH] Add Silver Light

4-star sword, 510 base ATK and 41.3% ATK at level 90 (the same growth
as Kagotsurube Isshin). Passive Radiance on the Water: Elemental Mastery
+52/65/78/91/104 for 12s after Elemental Skill use, max 2 stacks with
independent durations.

Stats and passive values from lunaris.moe (game data 7.2.0, weapon
11438). The generated files are written by hand in the pipeline's
format.
